# .lima.env — machine-local VM build settings (gitignored; copy to .lima.env).
# Each `path=value` line becomes a limactl --set at VM creation; to change
# later, `just vm-rebuild`. (The VM name lives in .just.env instead.)
#
#   user.name=boxer   guest user (default: your macOS username; your Mac
#                     uid is kept so mounted files stay writable — ssh and
#                     the docker-group fix follow it automatically)
#   cpus / memory / disk   sizing guidance in vm/ai-box.yaml
#
# user.name=boxer
# cpus=8
# memory=32GiB
# disk=200GiB
